# Legacy password grant request
POST /oauth/token HTTP/1.1
Host: auth.example.test
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=password&username=pat@example.test&password=correct+horse+battery+staple&scope=profile+orders:read

HTTP/1.1 200 OK
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "access_token": "at_ropc_123",
  "token_type": "Bearer",
  "expires_in": 3600,
  "refresh_token": "rt_ropc_123",
  "scope": "profile orders:read"
}
